# "Your Nth turn" counts every turn the wearer has begun, an extra turn among them (CR 500.7, 500.1): Bot1 casts Time Walk
# on its second turn (turn 3), so turn 4 is its third, and the Elf Warrior of "if it's your third turn" comes then - not on
# turn 5, Bot1's fourth.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x2
Time Walk
Island x37

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x40

[Variant]
Bot1: maximum 20; emblem Gear test: token-on-turn, turn 3, token elf-warrior
Bot2: maximum 20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Time Walk.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
[T4 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack = Gear test: token-on-turn, turn 3, token elf-warrior
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elf Warrior Token.Token = true
[T6 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
